WEBVTT

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:09.360
Tobi...

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.410
Haruka?

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:16.490
Yeah?

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:18.280
Huh? What?

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:20.410
Calm down, will ya.

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:23.210
Karasu? Where are you right now?

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.340
Karasu!

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:33.970
Karasu, hold on!

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:36.340
Karasu...

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:39.720
Haruka...

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:41.640
Karasu...

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:44.350
Haruka...

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:49.190
Where are you, Haruka?

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:54.700
I'm right here. I'm here, don't worry.

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:57.740
Haruka...

00:00:57.740 --> 00:00:59.780
I failed you again...

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:02.080
Karasu...

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:03.290
Haruka!

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:08.250
Haruka!

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:11.590
No... You can't, Karasu.

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:14.260
You said you would protect me!

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:21.720
Yuu... It's Karasu...

00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:24.770
He's...

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:32.230
He's not human!

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:35.280
Get away from him, Haruka!

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:35.780
No!

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:38.450
What are you talking about?!

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:40.740
You're putting yourself in danger
just by being near him!

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:42.120
You're wrong!

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:44.790
You're wrong.

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:48.120
He tried to protect me.

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:52.340
That's how he got hurt.

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:55.800
Haruka... But...

00:01:57.090 --> 00:01:58.470
Yuu?

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:03.720
You're Karasu, so you'll
help me, won't you?

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:06.430
Haruka...

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:47.740
Fukuro's Reizu has
completely disappeared.

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:50.660
Fukuro?!

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:52.540
That is the observers' conclusion.

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:55.250
Did Karasu do it?

00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:59.510
Did he kill Fukuro?!

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:02.930
What a bastard.

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:07.010
He would kill a friend to pursue
an illusion of a woman.

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:10.270
If this continues, in the near future...

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:13.480
La'cryma won't be able to hold back
the erosion of Shangri-la.

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:15.860
The Dragon Torque.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:19.230
Only if we can bring her to this land...

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:20.480
Don't you take things
into your own hands!

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:25.070
You and I are now...

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:27.700
the only ones left who can jump dimensions.

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:05.950
You okay, Atori?

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:07.990
Atori?

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:13.000
Who are you?

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:15.000
What?

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:22.510
This isn't a practical joke
intended to surprise me, is it?

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:25.010
I don't understand it very well either.

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:27.010
I don't know how to explain.

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:30.850
But...

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:33.470
He doesn't seem to be a bad guy, so...

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:35.640
...I want to help him.

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:38.480
Miss, what should I do?

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:40.980
What to do? I... I'm not sure...

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:51.370
Won't showing up at her house
out of nowhere make her wary?

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:53.910
There's no use worrying
about things like that.

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:57.830
I have to get in contact with
Dr. Mayuzumi as soon as possible.

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:02.250
Do you think Goto is okay on his own?

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:04.960
He'll be fine!
Yukie-chan is already there.

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:07.930
Miho, over here.

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:10.970
Fujiwara-kun! Shortcut!

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:12.510
God, what are they doing?

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:15.470
I'm sorry.

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:19.230
Is he all right?

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:21.400
What's the matter?

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:24.440
It's you...

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:28.900
Sara...

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:34.290
Sara, so that's where you've been.

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:36.750
Y... You wanna fight?

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:38.660
Sara.

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:40.830
Sara...

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:43.420
This is impossible, impossible...

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:44.090
Sara!

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:48.090
Sara...

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:50.550
I've been looking all over for you.

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:53.100
How could you make
your big brother worry?

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:54.050
Huh?

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:55.010
Sara...

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:56.600
Stop it!

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:00.060
He's weird! Weird!

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:02.100
He's a pedophile!
A child molestor!

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:04.020
Why you little...

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:07.320
Sara?

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:09.820
Isn't this guy out there?

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:11.570
Way out there.

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:15.910
There's something wrong with you!
My name is not Sara!

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:17.950
You're not Sara?

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:20.120
Sara...

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:22.040
Sara...

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:27.630
I think he's getting you
mixed up with his little sister.

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:32.340
He won't pose a threat to you.
I promise.

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:36.430
He doesn't seem to be a bad guy I guess...

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:37.810
Yeah.

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:39.730
They're dangerous, I tell you!

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:43.650
What are you freaking out for?
You're such a chicken, Fujiwara.

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:45.560
But they're really dangerous!

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:49.610
Hey, you seemed to be in a hurry.
Has something happened?

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:56.410
Wh... Why?!

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:59.160
Why are these guys with you?

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:01.540
Uh, it just happened?

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:02.710
Are you insane?!

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:05.420
I told you so.

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:07.960
It's okay, Goto.

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:11.470
They don't look so tough.

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:23.390
Don't worry...

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:26.020
I think he's lost his memory.

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:28.480
For real?

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:35.780
Atori.

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:43.500
What's the matter?

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:46.000
You know you can't go to sleep.

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:48.250
The girl is crying.

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:50.710
Hey...

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:52.970
You can hear me, can't you?

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:03.980
He's hurt pretty badly.

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:06.480
He's extremely weak too.

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:08.520
How is he?

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:11.860
Do something. You guys are
from the future too, aren't you?

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:13.740
F... From the future?

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:20.580
Well, how is he?!

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:22.660
It's no good.

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:25.540
He's used up too much
Reizu to self-regenerate himself.

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:29.000
Where is Fukuro, Karasu?

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:30.840
Fukuro...

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:32.170
Huh?

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:40.260
...is dead.

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:46.270
It wasn't Atori, right?

00:09:47.270 --> 00:09:48.400
No.

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:51.400
It wasn't him.

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:54.780
Only you have the power
to see dimensions.

00:09:55.650 --> 00:10:00.780
And by you looking at them,
they are finalized...

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:03.330
and become your reality.

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:06.120
A man wearing a mask...

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:10.290
Killed him... and hurt Karasu...

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:12.920
A mask?

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:14.050
Shangri-la!

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:18.300
Hey, Karasu won't die, will he?

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:20.090
At this rate...

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:24.010
he'll exhaust all of his
Reizu and he'll perish.

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:26.310
No way! Do something!

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:28.100
Can't you see Haruka is crying?!

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:31.310
If we can replenish him
with a large amount of Reizu...

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:33.270
we might be able to save him.

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:36.530
Reizu? What's that?

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:41.200
Reizu are the smallest elementary
particles that compose all matter.

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:45.330
They are the fundamental existence
that presides over time and space...

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:48.330
and all life and matter,
animate or inanimate.

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:52.290
I don't think they've been discovered
yet at this present day however.

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:55.090
Did you follow that, Yukie-chan?

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:57.300
Not one single word.

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:58.800
Impossible...

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:02.140
What is that?

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:07.310
There should be a Reizu convergence
point in this dimension as well.

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:15.820
I found it! We just
have to go to this point!

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:20.280
Will Karasu be saved if we go there?

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:23.490
Yeah, probably.

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:37.960
I swear I'll get him...

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:57.400
The look on your face tells me that you got nothing.

00:11:58.190 --> 00:12:01.070
Haruka-chan is out at the moment.

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:03.700
But I did get one piece of information.

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:07.370
Mayuzumi Takuya
does not live in that house.

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:11.210
There wasn't a single
pair of men's shoes.

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:13.420
Huh... I see...

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:19.710
Are you okay? Don't you find it cramped?

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:22.130
I'm used to this sort of thing.

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:25.220
Okay. Try to be patient, um...

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:27.430
I'm Tobi.

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:30.100
What?! You're not going with them?

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:32.480
We can't all fit in the car, you know.

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:35.980
Besides, I wouldn't be
of any help anyway.

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:39.190
Hey!

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:41.820
Just shut up and go with Kaminogi!

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:43.450
Isami!

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:46.070
All right, we'll call you right away
if anything happens.

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:46.700
Roger.

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:49.080
Take care of everyone.

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:52.200
Keep it together, Haruka.
Cheer up.

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:08.260
Did you see that?!

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:09.390
It's the girl!

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:27.240
Karasu...

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:35.290
What's wrong?

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:36.920
We're being followed.

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:41.920
Think they've noticed us?

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:44.260
The boy is with them.

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:46.430
So, where are they headed?

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:49.510
There's a pole of
quantum potential up here.

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:51.180
Just maybe...

00:13:54.470 --> 00:13:57.140
Hey, that teacher's really flying.

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:58.190
Don't lose them!

00:13:58.190 --> 00:14:00.690
Hang on tight, everyone!

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:03.440
M... Miss?!

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:22.460
Where the hell is she driving?

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:24.130
After her!

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:26.670
Okay!

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:32.180
Kooriyama-san!

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:34.350
Don't talk! You'll bite your tongue! Ow!

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:40.440
From the way she drives, she's
probably done rally racing before!

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:50.570
Why are we stopped?

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:51.740
We got a flat.

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:53.700
What?! How come?

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:56.750
Look! They're getting away!!!
Why, that brainless little bitch!

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:58.410
Kooriyama-san!

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:00.460
Calm down, Uchida-chan.

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:02.580
Freaking out won't help.

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:04.340
How come?!

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:11.260
We lost them, Miss!

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:12.590
Right on!

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:19.230
This is the place
where the Reizu converge.

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:21.600
A place like this?

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:25.110
Hold on, Karasu.
We're almost there.

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:31.990
Blue snow?

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:39.450
No way! What was that?

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:42.250
So, you're all together...

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:44.460
...Dragon Torque.

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:51.970
Even if Karasu managed to kill Fukuro...

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:54.930
it looks like he didn't get away with it.

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:57.390
You're wrong, Kosagi!

00:15:57.930 --> 00:15:59.890
Karasu isn't the one who killed Fukuro!

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:03.560
I don't believe the words of traitors.

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:05.270
Kosagi, let's stop this!

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:06.860
Pleading for your life are you?

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:11.650
How cowardly. In fact,
I couldn't care less about your lives.

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:13.910
Hand over the Torque.

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:15.660
Listen to me!

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:19.290
This dimension hasn't reached
the critical point like La'cryma has!

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:23.120
By being in this dimension,
the Torque may actually be the key...

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:25.250
to return all dimensions
to their original state!

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:27.250
I'm not interested in your predictions.

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:30.170
I will return with the Dragon Torque.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:34.010
That is my ultimate mission
as a dragon knight.

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:51.650
Atori, I would've never guessed you
to play nice with their little group.

00:16:51.650 --> 00:16:55.160
Hurry... Get the light of life.

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:57.160
Huh? Uh, right.

00:16:57.700 --> 00:16:59.620
Help me, everyone.

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:01.080
Who is she?

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:03.160
Just forget it. Miss, hurry!

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:07.250
Come on!

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:16.220
Be careful now.

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:20.010
Hey, this guy is a lot
lighter than he looks.

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:28.730
I made a promise.

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:32.030
I don't know who you are,
but I won't let you pass!

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:36.240
Are you really Atori?

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:57.760
Karasu!

00:17:57.760 --> 00:17:58.890
It's all right.

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:04.720
What is this?

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:08.310
Clouds are flowing towards us.

00:18:16.440 --> 00:18:18.780
No. I won't let you pass.

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:23.740
Pathetic. Have you also
forgotten how to fight?

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:31.210
Hold on! Hold on, Karasu!

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:43.720
You fool! What are you doing?!

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:47.430
Practice what you preach, you big jerk!

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:49.390
Stop making Haruka cry!

00:18:57.240 --> 00:19:00.200
Y... You're not human?!

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:03.620
For God's sake...

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:06.120
I guess it's the end
of the dragon knights.

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:21.760
Amazing...

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:24.470
He's healing.

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:34.940
Tobi-kun, are you okay?!

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:37.940
This is all my fault.

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:41.450
It's my fault for seeing that future.

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:43.700
That's not true.

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:46.280
It's impossible to have a future
that you can't choose.

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:50.960
There's absolutely no way
our future is laid out for us!

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:54.960
But if I go with her...

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:57.460
...Karasu will be saved.

00:19:57.880 --> 00:19:59.260
You can't!

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:02.720
Don't go, Haruka!

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:03.220
Yuu...

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:13.560
Why do you always
manage to tick me off?!

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:16.900
Yuu!

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:21.490
Dragon Torque...

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:24.030
Go to La'cryma and become an illusion!

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:25.530
Haruka!

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:31.120
Such a pest.

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:36.290
I promised.

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:40.130
I made her a promise.

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:43.130
Sara!

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:50.770
Haruka, run!

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:09.490
It's incredible.
I've never seen so much Reizu.

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:19.380
What is that? What the heck is that?

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:41.440
Fukuro...

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:44.570
Are you there, Fukuro?

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:50.450
Isami, have you met up with Haruka?

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:54.580
I'm going to stay here a while longer.

00:21:57.370 --> 00:21:59.000
Please tell Haruka...

00:22:00.790 --> 00:22:04.460
...that I will protect
the Haruka of this dimension.

00:22:14.680 --> 00:22:19.020
I told you that I would not
allow unauthorized activity.

00:22:38.580 --> 00:22:40.040
Haruka.

00:22:42.670 --> 00:22:44.050
Uh-huh.

00:22:46.880 --> 00:22:49.010
The future expands out into infinity.

00:22:49.840 --> 00:22:52.260
I'm sure we can make our own choices...

00:22:53.560 --> 00:22:55.010
...that we can choose our own futures.

00:23:01.020 --> 00:23:04.480
Yeah, that would be nice.

00:24:42.210 --> 00:24:45.170
I'm dreaming again.

00:24:45.170 --> 00:24:47.000
That summer day's dream.

00:24:48.170 --> 00:24:50.380
Haruka likes you better!

00:24:54.090 --> 00:24:55.890
Are they your drawings, Mom?

00:25:00.180 --> 00:25:03.430
So you don't even want
to talk to me anymore?

